  "description": "While working as a waiter at the bar ‘Nante’, Choi A-Seul received an unusually large tip from Seo Jin-Hyuk for simply serving drinks. For some reason, A-Seul couldn't forget that day. A month later, Jin-Hyeok, who hadn't been seen since, appears to rescue A-Seul from a sexual assault in a private room...\n\n *‘Does he remember...?’*\n\nJust as A-Seul's hopes rose, Jin-Hyeok pulled out a “token of appreciation.” ...It was a check.\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
